  IsRicciFlowOn := fun T u => ∀ t ∈ Set.Ioo (0:ℝ) T, HasDerivAt u ((-2 : ℝ) • D.ricci (u t)) t
  isDeTurckSolutionOn_iff := fun T u => Iff.rfl
  isRicciFlowOn_iff := fun T u => Iff.rfl
```
